,Captain Redemption,375,&H0015181B,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,2,15,15,15,1Style: Sign-Wano,KG Ten Thousand Reasons Alt,60,&H005B57D2,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,2,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:51.86,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:47.98,0:01:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gizli görev!Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.75,0:01:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır!Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.27,0:01:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu büyük bir savaş olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.05,0:01:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaş...Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.02,0:02:00.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima adındaki...Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.15,0:02:04.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido ve Canavar Korsanlarının adasında gerçekleşecek!Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.85,0:02:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ada mı?Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.10,0:02:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'da bile denizi geçmek zorunda mıyız?Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.77,0:02:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.69,0:02:18.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ada kıyıdan gözüküyor zaten, oraya gitmek için koca gemilere ihtiyacımız yok.Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.74,0:02:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima'ya baskın yapmak için...Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.20,0:02:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yine de bir gemiye ihtiyacımız olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.06,0:02:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiyi sonra düşünürüz.Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaşı ne zaman yapacağız?Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.33,0:02:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş Festivali gününde yapmalıyız.Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.00,0:02:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş Festivali başkent halkı için büyük bir festivaldir.Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.72,0:02:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun ülkeyi koruyan bir tanrı olduğuna inanılıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.68,0:02:49.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve o gün Orochi, tanrının huzuruna çıkmak için şogun alayı'nın başında Onigashima'ya gidecek.Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.78,0:02:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bu sadece bir bahane!Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.88,0:02:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl olacak olan şey, yetkililerin ve Canavar Korsanları'nın ziyafet vermesi!Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.28,0:03:06.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani parti yaparlarken sarhoş olmuş o aptalları dövüp...Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.16,0:03:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,liderlerinin kafasını keseceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.84,0:03:09.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.50,0:03:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kahramanlıklarımı görünce o sapık samurayı boşverip bana gönlünü kaptırabilirsin!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.73,0:03:20.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, hayır, Sanji-dono, yanlış anlamışsın.Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.63,0:03:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim karım var ve Okiku sadece yoldaşım, yani öyle bir ilişkimiz yok.Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.15,0:03:30.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otsuru-san iyiydi.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.02,0:03:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu gördün mü?Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.39,0:03:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, fark edilmeden.Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.10,0:03:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.81,0:03:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durumu iyiyse, güzel o zaman.Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.94,0:03:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük hedefimizi gerçekleştirene kadar onu göremem.Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.99,0:03:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.56,0:03:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, sen evli bir adamsın. Onun kalbini kazanma! Adil değil!Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.41,0:03:51.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okiku-chan! Lütfen bana karşı nazik ol.Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.85,0:03:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapat çeneni.Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.30,0:03:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Kiku inanılmaz derecede güçlü!Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.63,0:04:02.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güzel olduğu kadar güçlü demek ha?Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusursuz.Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.89,0:04:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, savaşın tarihini ve buluşma yerini belirten bir sembol çizdim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Engereğin üzerinde...Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Habu: EngerekDialogue: 50,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yanan iki kuş...Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.98,0:04:19.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve isyan anlamına gelen ters hilal!Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.11,0:04:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Ateş Festivali günü. Akşam alacasında. Kuşun ikinci saati.Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.82,0:04:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Habu Limanında."Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.24,0:04:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Kuşun ikinci saati" Wano'da  17:30 - 18:00 saatleri demektir.Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.04,0:04:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endişelenmeyin. Wano halkı mesajı anlayacaktır.Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.22,0:04:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen etrafta dolaşıp sol ayak bileklerinde ay işareti olanlara bu kâğıtları vermeliyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.34,0:04:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay işareti, isyanın sembolüdür.Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar müttefiklerimizdir!Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.31,0:04:56.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'da nerede olduklarını bilmiyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.42,0:04:59.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak mümkün olduğu kadar çok kişiye dağıtmak için...Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.15,0:05:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,arkadaşlarımız tüm ülkeye yayıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.57,0:05:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zorojuro-dono ve Usohachi-dono da bu görevi başkentte yürütüyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.33,0:05:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro'nun hiç yardımcı olmadığına eminim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.66,0:05:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dahası, Onigashima'ya vardıktan  sonra kaybolmamak için...Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.99,0:05:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun konağının tasarımını yapan marangozdan planları almaya çalışıyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.76,0:05:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden Franosuke-dono'yu bu işe atadık.Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.49,0:05:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orobi-dono'ya gelince, Orochi'nin ordusunun tüm hamlelerini öğrenmemiz şart.Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.32,0:05:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden Orochi'nin yanına sızabilmek için geyşa kılığına girmesini istedim!Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu anda çok ünlü olduğunu duydum.Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.93,0:05:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan'ı geyşa kıyafetiyle görmek istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.20,0:05:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi size de görevler vermek istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.80,0:05:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook-dono'nun yeteneği, başkentte yiyecek almayı sağlayacaktır.Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.76,0:05:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He? Emin misin?Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.13,0:06:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-dono'nun hava yetenekleri ninjutsudan farksız, bu sebeple kunoichi rolü yapacak!Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.84,0:06:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kadın ninja he?Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kunoichi Onami!Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san, kunoichi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.51,0:06:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-dono'nun aşçılığı kalabalığı çekecek, biz de aralarından gönüllüler bulacağız.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.89,0:06:20.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-dono?Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.57,0:06:21.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana bırak!Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.81,0:06:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki ya ben?Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.36,0:06:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot-dono'nun ve Chopper-dono'nun, Kiku'yla birlikte Inuarashi'yle görüşmesini istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.71,0:06:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon! Ben de ninja olmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.32,0:06:33.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır!Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.85,0:06:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her birinize uygun kıyafetler vereceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.25,0:06:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden kafanıza bir yaprak koyun ve hazır olun!Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır mısınız?Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başlıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.45,0:06:49.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte büyülü gücüm!Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.97,0:06:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kıyafet Tekniği!Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.47,0:06:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puf!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-swaan!Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja!Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.36,0:07:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano tarzı kıyafetler giydiğinize göre görevlerinizi yapmanızı istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle, Kin'emon!Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.03,0:07:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu gerçekten kunoichi kıyafeti mi?Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.49,0:07:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kunoichi dediğin...Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.12,0:07:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,böyle görünmelidir!Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.66,0:07:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalan söylüyorsun değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi, bir rehber çağıracağım.Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.49,0:07:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gerçek bir kunoichi'dir.Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.17,0:07:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçek kunoichi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.76,0:07:34.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte büyük zevk!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni mi çağırdın?Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.36,0:07:49.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu tamamen yanlış!Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.45,0:07:53.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! – Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.55,0:07:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umudumu...Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.42,0:07:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kaybetmeyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.58,0:08:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz! Şokun etkisiyle titriyor!Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.79,0:08:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon! Ağzının tadı bu he?Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.17,0:08:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kunoichi'ler seksi veya demode olmalıdır. İki türleri vardır.Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkıştırırsam iş görür aslında.Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.68,0:08:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook, sen ne kılığına girdin?Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.67,0:08:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafasına külot giyen birine.Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.36,0:08:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle sanıyordum ama yanılmışım!Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.86,0:08:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Genç olmak...Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.46,0:08:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hiç kötü değil.Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adım Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eskiden Kin-sama'yla kardeş gibiydik.Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.91,0:08:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama şu anda...Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.89,0:08:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,imza hareketim, Baştan Çıkarma Tekniği'dir.Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Memnun oldum.Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.89,0:08:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san olmasaydı ruhum yok olurdu.Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.09,0:08:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.09,0:08:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum, genç adam.Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olgun kadınlar...Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ölümcül silah gibidirler.Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.56,0:09:08.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buluşma süresine kadar ayrı kalacağız ama...Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.78,0:09:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,aramanızı istediğim üç özel samuray var!Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.36,0:09:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları bulabilirsek büyük yardımları dokunacaktır!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.45,0:09:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu.Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.19,0:09:19.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ashura Doji.Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.47,0:09:20.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denjiro.Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.91,0:09:25.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar da bizim gibi Oden-sama'ya hizmet eden samuraylardı!Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.67,0:09:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim! Buradaki müttefiklerimiz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.63,0:09:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hedeflerimiz, Yonko Kaido ve  iğrenç şogun Kurozumi Orochi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.59,0:09:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hareket tarihi iki hafta sonra! Ateş Festivali gecesinde!Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.85,0:09:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun yaşadığı Onigashima'ya...Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.73,0:09:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,baskın yapacağız!Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?! – Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Selamlar!Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.75,0:10:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe koyulun!Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.41,0:10:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dangalakların elinde iyi mallar var!Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri verin! Onları Luffytaro-san...Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffytaro-san bize verdi!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.03,0:10:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes be!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.70,0:11:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anneciğim!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.76,0:11:05.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Meyveden tut, sake'yle pirince kadar var! Utanmazlara bak hele!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.73,0:11:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri verin lütfen! Torunuma yedireceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.64,0:11:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafa sikme dayı! Geber git artık!Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.79,0:11:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir şeyi...Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.95,0:11:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hangi sıçtığım yaptı?Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.91,0:11:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlara yemek verip kahramanlığa soyunmak mı?Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.12,0:11:35.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayaliniz kısa sürdü ama...Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.71,0:11:39.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tam yemek bulmuşken...Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.09,0:11:42.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bize kaptırıp yine aç kalacaksınız.Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.80,0:11:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin gibi acizleri koruyacak bir samuray kalmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.22,0:11:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ülkede çetin samuraylara önderlik edebilecek...Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.96,0:11:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,adam gibi bir adam da yok artık!Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.55,0:12:05.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun sonu geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak hele kocakarı...Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.63,0:12:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha yıllarca yaşasan da acı gerçekten başka bir bok görmeyeceksin.Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel de sefaletine son vereyim!Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.27,0:12:32.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen kaç!Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nine!Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.22,0:12:44.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otoki-sama'nın sözüne inanıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.17,0:12:49.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geberdi gitti.Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.71,0:12:52.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dokuz samurayın...Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.48,0:12:55.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'nın arzusunu yerine getireceğinden şüphem yok!Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.58,0:12:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyinsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.39,0:13:01.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başlarında bir önder olmadan savaşa giremezler!Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shutenmaru-sama! O...Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.82,0:13:37.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nihayet karşılaşabildik...Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.65,0:13:44.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hırsızların lideri.Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.73,0:13:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-C-C-Canavar!Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.71,0:13:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buralara Hasır Şapka Luffy isminde bir korsanın gelmiş olması lazım.Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.00,0:14:00.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Haberim yok." desem davranışına çekidüzen verir misin?Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.12,0:14:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaşınma derim.Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.29,0:14:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.69,0:14:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni sağ bırakmamızın tek sebebi...Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.58,0:14:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san'ın seni mürettebata katmak istemesidir.Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.47,0:14:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana saygı göstermeme lüzum yok!Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.65,0:14:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse hemen söyleyeyim.Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.80,0:14:29.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsteğinize yanıtım budur!Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.47,0:14:41.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana Kin'emon, planını anladım da...Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.08,0:14:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,idrak edemediğim bir husus var.Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.77,0:14:49.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,20 yıl evvel, Oden'in Ashura Doji'yi yendiğini söylemiştin.Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.57,0:14:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse bulmamızı istediğin müttefikler arasında ne arıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.27,0:14:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yerinde bir soru.Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.27,0:15:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ashura Doji, Oden-sama'ya yenilince kendini düzelterek...Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.77,0:15:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,efendimize bağlılık yemini etti.Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.53,0:15:11.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat...Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.47,0:15:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdilerde Atama Dağı Hırsızları lideri olarak Shutenmaru ismiyle...Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.95,0:15:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yine eski günlere döndüğünü işittik.Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.31,0:15:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ya, hırsızlar demek?Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.62,0:15:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu arada,Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.49,0:15:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,güçlü biri midir?Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.66,0:15:36.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, muhtemelen en güçlü samuray olduğunu söylemek yanlış olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.25,0:15:43.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak sen!Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.22,0:16:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir samurayı küçümsemeyeceksin!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jack-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.08,0:16:21.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağzına sıçtığımın...Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.54,0:17:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri çekilin! Shutenmaru ile Jack-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.77,0:17:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birbirine girdiler!Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.56,0:17:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonumuz geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.51,0:17:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O adam, aramızdan ayrıldığından beri...Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.22,0:18:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ölmek için bahane arıyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.48,0:18:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat...Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.27,0:18:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,senin gibi bir ayakçının elinden olmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zevzeklik etme!Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.09,0:18:33.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.05,0:18:39.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o gün ölmeliydim!Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.93,0:18:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaşamak tam bir işkence.Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.60,0:19:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,J-Jack-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.80,0:19:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bakın... Gökyüzü!Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.55,0:19:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz! Neden ama?Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.90,0:19:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hangi amaçla teşrif ediyor ki?Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.03,0:19:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Benim yüzümden mi? Ondan mı?Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.75,0:19:49.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnfazım için mi geliyor?Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.71,0:19:52.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birden ne oldu böyle?Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.27,0:19:53.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yağmur mu geliyor?Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.60,0:19:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır!Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.71,0:19:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hasır Şapka-ya! Çabuk gel!Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.29,0:20:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu, Trao?Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'oluyor?Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.15,0:20:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne? Momonosuke-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Ejderha mı oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.36,0:20:31.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonra izah edeceğim, vücudu böyle dönüşebiliyor artık!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.06,0:20:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hem de gide gide...Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.16,0:20:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,iğrenç bir ejderha şekline giriyor!Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başımız belada, Hasır Şapka-ya.Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.07,0:20:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çekil! Önümden çekil!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.05,0:20:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yok daha neler!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.21,0:21:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama neden?Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.91,0:21:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak hele Jack.Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.72,0:21:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredin.Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.58,0:21:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Derhâl o veletleri...Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.92,0:21:23.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,huzuruma getir.Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.84,0:21:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ejderha mı? O da ne öyle?Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.85,0:21:32.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha beteri olamazdı.Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.88,0:21:33.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O şey...Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.78,0:21:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.85,0:21:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek o...Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.67,0:21:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.81,0:22:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido bir ejderha mıymış?Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.05,0:22:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.73,0:22:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gördüğünüz şey, Kaido'dur!Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.09,0:22:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido...Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.26,0:22:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ejderhaya dönüşebiliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.00,0:23:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okobore Kasabası orada!Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.19,0:23:05.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet. İyi de Kaido durduk yere niye Kuri'ye geldi ki?Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.37,0:23:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Affet, Kin'emon.Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.81,0:23:11.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğrusu Hasır Şapka-ya, Zoro-ya ile ben, kendimizi ele verdik.Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.95,0:23:12.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.00,0:23:18.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama hepsi bundan ibaret, planımız açığa çıkmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.38,0:23:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bundan ibaretmiş!Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.08,0:23:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne halt yiyorsun lan Law?Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.71,0:23:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar ağzını hiç açmasın!Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.80,0:23:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha, kesin Luffy'nin halt yemesidir.Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.22,0:23:33.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzgün olduğumuzu bil yeter!Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.14,0:23:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük ihtimalle...Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.56,0:23:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,benimle Hasır Şapka-ya'yı arıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.00,0:23:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun emri altındaki Canavar Korsanları'nın...Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.10,0:23:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sahip olduğu emsalsiz kuvvetin iki temel dayanağı var.Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.50,0:23:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlki, Kaido'nun bu ülke halkına imal ettirdiği silahlar!Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.18,0:24:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diğeri ise, Doflamingo ve Caesar'ın ürettiği GÜLÜCÜK şeytan meyvelerinin yeraltı ticareti.Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.85,0:24:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun da yuvası olan Punk Hazard'daki fabrikayı yok edip...Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.34,0:24:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,GÜLÜCÜK tedariki için elzem olan Caesar'ı esir aldık.Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.85,0:24:20.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca,Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.71,0:24:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun önemli bir ticaret ortağı...Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.10,0:24:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo'nun işlettiği Dressrosa'daki fabrikayı da yok ettik.Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.36,0:24:34.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gedikli müşterisi Doflamingo'ya hapsi boylatarak fişini çektik.Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.03,0:24:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özetle,Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.02,0:24:42.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,savaşın kıvılcımını biz çaktık.Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.01,0:24:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peşinde olduğu, başından beri...Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.20,0:24:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,benimle Hasır Şapka-ya'nın kellesidir!Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.42,0:24:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.67,0:24:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.65,0:24:55.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono!Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.62,0:24:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kıpırdamayın! Ben giderim!Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.33,0:25:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birkaçımız daha açığa çıkarsa...Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.56,0:25:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar'la Kalp Korsanları mürettebatının tümünün geldiğini anlarlar!Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.42,0:25:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topyekûn peşimize düşerler!Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.57,0:25:18.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O yüzden kafayı kullanalım.Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.93,0:25:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizden başkasını görmediler.Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.16,0:25:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Planınız hâlâ güvende.Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.89,0:25:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaştık mı?Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.84,0:25:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki siz ne yapacaksınız?Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.84,0:25:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç karışmamayı yeğlerdim ama...Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.31,0:25:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-ya halkla içli dışlı oldu bile.Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.58,0:25:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duygularına yenik düşerse bir çuval incir berbat olur.Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.58,0:26:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük günde hep birlikte olmayacaksak ittifakın da bir anlamı kalmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.53,0:26:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çaresine bakacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.00,0:26:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oda!Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.47,0:26:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne pahasına olursa olsun kendinizi ele vermeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.14,0:26:22.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Değişim!Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.10,0:26:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.62,0:26:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulan Luffy... Biz yokken ne haltlar yedi ki?Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.40,0:26:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ormana çekilin, Atama Dağı Hırsızları!Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.17,0:26:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona bulaşmak istemiyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.71,0:27:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuri'nin dağlarında...Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.38,0:27:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kudretli bir hırsız olduğunu işitip duruyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.99,0:27:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shutenmaru.Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni...Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.29,0:27:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hatırlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.63,0:28:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama geçmişe mazi derler!Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.70,0:28:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emrim altına girersen...Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.45,0:28:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,geçmişe sünger çekeriz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.29,0:28:48.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öh! Leş gibi alkol kokuyor!Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.28,0:28:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa sarhoş musun, Kaido-san?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.80,0:28:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dangalak! Ben sarhoş olmam!Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.88,0:28:59.63,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,– Körkütük sarhoş! – Körkütük sarhoş!Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.70,0:29:12.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'apacaksın, Shutenmaru?Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.46,0:29:17.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Araya mesafe koyamıyoruz! Kapışsak mı acaba?Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.11,0:29:26.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jack-sama! Kanamayı durdurmaya çalışırken kımıldamayın!Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.42,0:29:30.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar sarhoşken her an gözü dönebilir.Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.99,0:29:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de uzaklaşsak iyi olur.Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.58,0:29:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orası öyle de...Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.77,0:29:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okobore Kasabası halkı, fabrikalardaki iş gücünün önemli bir kısmını oluşturuyor!Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.35,0:29:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İbretlik oluşturmak tamam da...Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.01,0:29:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bilinçsizce yakıp yıkarsa geriye ne onlardan...Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.22,0:29:50.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ne de Kuri'den eser kalır.Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.44,0:29:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden daha önce söylemedin, Kiku?Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.26,0:29:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Af buyur, Kin-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.73,0:30:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri dönsene, Tsuru'yu ben kurtarırım!Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.65,0:30:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmaz, benim de bir sorumluluğum var!Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.71,0:30:08.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendisine kol kanat gerecek biriyle evlenmediğine inanamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.91,0:30:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ondan ayrıldığımdan bu yana 20 yıl geçti!Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.27,0:30:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen geliyorum, Tsuru!Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.67,0:30:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçayım! Hâlâ çok mesafe var!Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.78,0:30:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-ya!Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.76,0:30:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trao! Okobore Kasabası sakinleri zarar görmüş müdür sence?Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.47,0:30:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyinsiz! Görüyor musun işte? Korsanlar iyilik yaparsa...Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.39,0:30:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,olacağı bu!Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.27,0:30:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido bizi istiyor, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.77,0:30:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:31:01.46,0:31:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başkomutan Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.82,0:31:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O adam...Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.80,0:31:08.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir öncü değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.01,0:31:13.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başkomutan'ım! Hasır Şapka Luffy'yle Trafalgar Law'u arıyorsanız...Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.67,0:31:19.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden Kalesi'nin kalıntılarında saklanıyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.62,0:31:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden Kalesi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.00,0:31:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hawkins!Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.82,0:31:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka'yla Law'un Oden Kalesi'nde saklandığı doğru mu?Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.46,0:31:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, Başkomutan Kaido'nun sinirini yatıştırmak için yalan söyledim.Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.88,0:31:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dahası da var ama.Dialogue: 50,0:31:48.53,0:31:51.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Belki de malum efsaneden dolayı şu günlerde...Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.93,0:31:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dağın zirvesinde şüpheli ışıklar gördüğünü söyleyenler var.Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.51,0:31:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Efsane mi?Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.42,0:32:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,20 yıl evvel katledilen...Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.94,0:32:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki samuraylarının intikam için döneceğini anlatan efsane mi?Dialogue: 50,0:32:05.98,0:32:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:32:07.28,0:32:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şogun Orochi'nin korkmasına göz yummaktansa...Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.40,0:32:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,terk edilmiş kaleyi yok ederek bir taşla iki kuş vurabiliriz.Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.02,0:32:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden Kalesi mi dedin?Dialogue: 50,0:32:34.86,0:32:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anılarım depreşti bak! Cidden iyi bir in.Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.96,0:32:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek oradaydılar.Dialogue: 50,0:32:47.31,0:32:50.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,GÜLÜCÜK'ü elimden aldılar!Dialogue: 50,0:32:50.73,0:32:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağzına sıçtığımın yeni yetmeleri!Dialogue: 50,0:32:56.98,0:32:58.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elimden kaçırmayacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:33:03.69,0:33:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden Kalesi'nin kalıntılarına gidiyor!Dialogue: 50,0:33:22.99,0:33:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:33:27.35,0:33:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan! Üzerimize doğru gelmiyor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:33:30.84,0:33:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Mümkün değil! – Mümkün değil!Dialogue: 50,0:33:33.82,0:33:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa bizi mi fark etti?Dialogue: 50,0:33:36.53,0:33:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne? – Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:33:38.20,0:33:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:33:39.62,0:33:42.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O mesafeden fark etmesi imkânsız.Dialogue: 50,0:33:45.58,0:33:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır.Dialogue: 50,0:33:48.54,0:33:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzerimize geliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:33:56.20,0:33:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçın millet!Dialogue: 50,0:34:05.87,0:34:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido neden oraya gidiyor ki?Dialogue: 50,0:34:39.72,0:34:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:34:55.69,0:34:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz! Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:35:11.87,0:35:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes kaçsın!Dialogue: 50,0:35:16.82,0:35:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıcak Nefes!Dialogue: 50,0:35:44.49,0:35:47.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Kaptan! – Kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:36:51.35,0:36:55.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:46.33,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,ShutenmaruDialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:41.91,Captions Wano,,0,0,0,,Shinobu Kıdemli KunoichiDialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.28,Captions Wano,,0,0,0,,Okobore KasabasıDialogue: 50,0:10:18.30,0:10:19.68,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Cennet"Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:30.60,Captions Wano,,0,0,0,,Shutenmaru Atama Dağı Hırsızları LideriDialogue: 50,0:10:49.50,0:10:52.58,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Sake"Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:48.05,Captions Wano,,0,0,0,,Jack Önder, Canavar KorsanlarıDialogue: 50,0:32:50.86,0:32:55.16,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Law ile Hasır Şapka Korsan İttifakı"Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video DüzenlemeDialogue: 1,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video DüzenlemeDialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,FeesoDialogue: 1,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,FeesoDialogue: 2,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,FeesoDialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,ZamanlamaDialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,ZamanlamaDialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 2,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DizgiDialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DizgiDialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Gab PhosCityDialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Gab PhosCityDialogue: 2,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Gab PhosCityDialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.51,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalite KontrolDialogue: 1,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.51,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalite KontrolDialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.51,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DolphinWeabu Galaxy 9000 Grug PepperjackDialogue: 1,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.51,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DolphinWeabu Galaxy 9000 Grug PepperjackDialogue: 2,0:00:34.93,0